    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lost Room: Escape</strong> thrusts you into a relentless nightmare where survival is your only goal. Trapped in a cursed, dimly lit apartment, you must find a way out while being relentlessly pursued by a monstrous entity that seems to anticipate your every move. The apartment is a labyrinth of shadowy corridors and locked rooms, with puzzles and hidden clues standing between you and freedom. But there\u2019s no time to lose\u2014every second counts as the creature draws closer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370600/extras/0c9d249e947a6469bc23a1d7dab071ef.poster.avif?t=1734684364\" width=400 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370600/extras/0c9d249e947a6469bc23a1d7dab071ef.webm?t=1734684364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370600/extras/0c9d249e947a6469bc23a1d7dab071ef.mp4?t=1734684364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adding to the tension is your flashlight, your only source of light in the suffocating darkness. Its batteries drain rapidly, forcing you to constantly search for replacements while navigating the apartment. The flickering beam is both a lifeline and a curse, illuminating crucial clues but also risking exposure to the monster lurking nearby. Every time the light dims, the terror mounts, as you\u2019re left wondering if you\u2019ll find more batteries in time\u2014or be plunged into total darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370600/extras/6be0624e2314bb1b57140cd996becf3b.poster.avif?t=1734684364\" width=400 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370600/extras/6be0624e2314bb1b57140cd996becf3b.webm?t=1734684364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370600/extras/6be0624e2314bb1b57140cd996becf3b.mp4?t=1734684364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival requires sharp thinking and quick reflexes. The puzzles aren\u2019t just about logic but demand speed and precision under immense pressure. Hesitation or missteps can cost you dearly, as the monster never stops hunting, reacting to every sound and movement. With no weapons or means to fight back, your choices are brutally simple: run or hide. Each encounter is a battle of nerves, as you scramble to find cover or sprint away, all while the creature closes in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370600/extras/42ad7d93252422378805a0c9af0a95d0.poster.avif?t=1734684364\" width=400 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370600/extras/42ad7d93252422378805a0c9af0a95d0.webm?t=1734684364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370600/extras/42ad7d93252422378805a0c9af0a95d0.mp4?t=1734684364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lost Room: Escape</strong> delivers an unrelenting horror experience where danger lurks in every shadow, and the faint glow of your flashlight might be the only thing standing between you and the void. Can you think fast, act faster, and find your way out before the darkness consumes you?</p>",
